# NAME
#        secrets.env — real API tokens for the egress proxy
#
# SYNOPSIS
#        echo "$TOKEN" | o3s secret add NAME
#
# DESCRIPTION
#        One NAME=token per line, written by o3s secret add and listed by o3s secret ls. The
#        proxy swaps in the matching token on egress, keyed on the destination host, and a
#        changed token takes effect on the next request.
#
#        The only copy of the real tokens, held outside the workspace and never mounted into it.
#
# SEE ALSO
#        o3s.json, whose hosts name these tokens in their secret field.
